
========================================================================================
Docker swarm을 이용한 서비스 런칭

$ ./deploy_service.sh <server_name>
<-- server_name is one of cym, yujin, kumho, kumho_car, asia_ansung, jaeil_robot, etc.

------

Docker swarm 관련 유용한 명령어들

Show all the nodes in a docker swarm:
$ docker node ls

Show labels for all nodes:
$ docker node ls -q | xargs -n1 docker node inspect \
  --format '{{ .Description.Hostname }}  {{ .Spec.Labels }}'

Add label to a node:
$ docker node update --label-add key=value <node-id>

Remove label from a node:
$ docker node update --label-rm key <node-id>

Remove a service:
$ docker service rm <service-name>

Filter services by node label:
$ docker service ls --filter 'node.labels.key=value'

Filter tasks by node label:
$ docker service ps <service-name> --filter 'node.labels.key=value'

Remove all the services deployed by "docker stack deploy"
$ docker stack rm <stack-name>

Check Repo Digest of the image a certain container is created by
$ docker inspect <container_id> | grep sha

Check the error status for a service
$ docker service ps <service_name> --no-trunc
========================================================================================

